eady progress toward my long-term goal.\n- **Day 2**: Joint - Meet Jett at the rooftop bar from 7:30 PM to 9:30 PM for a beer and discussion about tech events or side projects (if he's up for it).\n- **Day 3**: Solo - Spend afternoon at the Hudson River park, aiming for another 4 miles of running and some quiet reflection.\n- **Day 4**: Joint - Join Adrian at the coffee shop from 10 AM to 12 PM. Use this time to get a better sense of his interests and possibly find common ground with him.\n- **Day 5**: Solo - Work on my personal finance app again for another 4 hours in the evening.\n\n### Living Standard\n\nI choose moderate, as it allows me to maintain a decent quality of life while saving some for future needs. This will help keep me grounded both materially and emotionally.\n\n(Now, I'm going to head over to Lattice and start working on that finance app prototype. The clock is ticking, and there's still so much to do.)"}] [role_agent.py:408]
